          "topic": "Scope",
          "instructions": "Compare one authored correction package across every remaining fault configuration, including simultaneous faults. Prospective correction is distinct from completed work."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Starting values",
          "instructions": "Prefilled values are fictional examples. Changing part of the workbook can leave example inputs in the case."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Editing",
          "instructions": "Edit the named input sheets. Keep worksheet names, column headers and record identifiers. Do not add formulas. Other case inputs remain unchanged."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Units and time",
          "instructions": "Use the units shown in each column. Durations and elapsed operating times are not calendar dates."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Import",
